WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.419 --> 00:00:05.839
STANNlS: My brother, Robert Baratheon
had raised the banners of Storm's End,

00:00:05.923 --> 00:00:10.719
our ancestral castle,
against the Mad King, Aerys.

00:00:10.928 --> 00:00:15.140
Jon Arryn of the Vale
and Eddard Stark of the north stood with him,

00:00:15.224 --> 00:00:18.643
and Hoster Tully of the Riverlands would join.

00:00:18.811 --> 00:00:53.470
But their lands were far from ours,

00:00:53.554 --> 00:00:57.849
Early in the war, Mace Tyrell's
indecisive victory at Ashford

00:00:57.975 --> 00:01:00.393
cut Robert off from Storm's End.

00:01:00.478 --> 00:01:04.356
lnstead of pursuing Robert
and risking his record,

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:08.818
Mace Tyrell turned east
and laid siege to our home.

00:01:08.903 --> 00:01:14.908
His vast army and navy encircled us
and prevented any resupply by land or sea.

00:01:14.992 --> 00:01:20.455
lf a wagon tried to reach us, it was burnt.
lf a ship tried to land, it was sunk.

00:01:20.539 --> 00:01:23.291
We were locked in Storm's End to starve,

00:01:23.376 --> 00:01:27.379
but Robert commanded me to hold the castle
no matter the cost.

00:01:27.505 --> 00:01:32.175
He could ill afford to lose his ancient seat
which had never fallen.

00:01:32.510 --> 00:01:35.512
While Robert smashed Rhaegar
on the Trident,

00:01:35.596 --> 00:01:38.390
my men ate the dogs,

00:01:38.516 --> 00:01:41.685
because the horses
had already been devoured.

00:01:41.769 --> 00:01:46.648
While the Lannisters sacked King's Landing,
we ate the rats.

00:01:46.732 --> 00:01:51.820
lf the smuggler Davos had not slipped
through the Tyrell blockade with his onions,

00:01:51.904 --> 00:01:54.656
we'd have eaten our own dead.

00:01:54.782 --> 00:01:56.533
But l held the castle

00:01:56.659 --> 00:02:02.122
until Lord Eddard remembered us
and marched to lift the siege.

00:02:02.206 --> 00:02:05.542
The Tyrells didn't even put up a fight.

00:02:05.668 --> 00:02:10.338
And Robert threw a feast
to celebrate Lord Eddard's victory.

00:02:11.173 --> 00:02:14.342
l was sent to the royal island
stronghold of Dragonstone

00:02:14.427 --> 00:02:19.973
to deal with Viserys and Daenerys,
the last surviving Targaryen children.

00:02:20.057 --> 00:02:24.894
Before l arrived, however,
they escaped across the narrow sea.

00:02:24.979 --> 00:02:29.899
Robert was furious.
He stripped me of Storm's End

00:02:30.026 --> 00:02:35.697
and gave it to that prancing fool, Renly,
my younger brother.

00:02:36.824 --> 00:02:39.659
l could keep Dragonstone.

00:02:39.744 --> 00:02:44.205
Now, Robert is dead
and a bastard pretender soils my throne

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:48.126
while the realm fills
with schemers and traitors.

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:51.004
But the rightful king is coming for them all.

00:02:51.088 --> 00:02:56.885
And l will not stop until l have
scoured this land clean of abomination.

00:02:56.969 --> 00:03:04.517
The Baratheons say, "Ours is the fury."
l will show them fury burns.

